## 4. 流分配算法

### 4.1 接口设计

采用函数式回调设计：

```cpp
namespace minidag {

// 流分配回调类型
using StreamAllocFunc = std::function<void(DAGGraph&)>;

class StreamAllocator {
public:
    // 内置策略
    static void ByLoadBalance(DAGGraph& graph, int32_t max_streams);
    static void ByCostAware(DAGGraph& graph, int32_t max_streams);
    static void ByTopological(DAGGraph& graph, int32_t max_streams);

    // 应用自定义回调
    static void Apply(DAGGraph& graph, StreamAllocFunc func);

private:
    StreamAllocator() = delete;
};

} // namespace minidag
```

### 4.2 内置策略说明

| 策略            | 说明                                                       |
| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ByLoadBalance` | 负载均衡策略，按流负载均匀分配                             |
| `ByCostAware`   | 成本感知策略，考虑节点的compute_cycles、memory_usage等成本 |
| `ByTopological` | 拓扑序策略，按topo_id顺序循环分配stream                    |

### 4.3 使用示例

```cpp
#include "minidag/graph.h"
#include "minidag/stream_allocator.h"

// 方式1: 使用内置策略
auto graph = std::make_shared<minidag::DAGGraph>("my_graph");
// ... 构建图 ...

minidag::StreamAllocator::ByLoadBalance(*graph, 4);
minidag::StreamAllocator::ByCostAware(*graph, 4);

// 方式2: 使用自定义回调
minidag::StreamAllocator::Apply(*graph, [](minidag::DAGGraph& g) {
    int64_t stream_id = 0;
    for (auto& node : g.GetAllNodes()) {
        if (node->GetType() == "Data") {
            node->SetStreamId(0);
        } else if (node->GetType() == "NetOutput") {
            node->SetStreamId(0);
        } else {
            node->SetStreamId(stream_id % 2 + 1);
            stream_id++;
        }
    }
});
```

## 5. DAGAdapter 设计

### 5.1 类定义

```cpp
namespace minidag {

class DAGAdapter {
public:
    DAGAdapter() = delete;

    // GE Graph -> DAGGraph
    static std::shared_ptr<DAGGraph> FromGEGraph(const ge::Graph& ge_graph);

    // 将DAGGraph的stream ID注入到GE Graph
    // 需要在CustomAllocateStreamPassFunc中调用
    static graphStatus RefreshStreamIdsToGE(
        const DAGGraph& dag_graph,
        ge::StreamPassContext& context);

private:
    static void ConvertNodes(const ge::Graph& ge_graph, DAGGraph& dag_graph,
                             std::unordered_map<std::string, std::shared_ptr<DAGNode>>& node_map);
    static void ConvertEdges(const ge::Graph& ge_graph, DAGGraph& dag_graph,
                             const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::shared_ptr<DAGNode>>& node_map);
    static void IdentifyInputOutputNodes(const ge::Graph& ge_graph, DAGGraph& dag_graph,
                                         const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::shared_ptr<DAGNode>>& node_map);
};

} // namespace minidag
```

### 5.2 转换流程

#### 5.2.1 FromGEGraph: GE Graph -> DAGGraph

```cpp
std::shared_ptr<DAGGraph> DAGAdapter::FromGEGraph(const ge::Graph& ge_graph) {
    // 1. 创建DAGGraph
    ge::AscendString name;
    ge_graph.GetName(name);
    auto dag_graph = std::make_shared<DAGGraph>(name.GetString());

    // 2. 节点映射表
    std::unordered_map<std::string, std::shared_ptr<DAGNode>> node_map;

    // 3. 转换节点
    ConvertNodes(ge_graph, *dag_graph, node_map);

    // 4. 转换边
    ConvertEdges(ge_graph, *dag_graph, node_map);

    // 5. 识别输入输出节点
    IdentifyInputOutputNodes(ge_graph, *dag_graph, node_map);

    return dag_graph;
}
```

**节点转换细节**：

```cpp
void DAGAdapter::ConvertNodes(const ge::Graph& ge_graph, DAGGraph& dag_graph,
                              std::unordered_map<...>& node_map) {
    auto gnodes = ge_graph.GetAllNodes();
    for (const auto& gnode : gnodes) {
        ge::AscendString name, type;
        gnode.GetName(name);
        gnode.GetType(type);

        auto node = dag_graph.AddNode(name.GetString(), type.GetString());

        // 提取成本信息（如果有）
        int64_t compute_cycles = 0;
        if (gnode.GetAttr("compute_cycles", compute_cycles) == GRAPH_SUCCESS) {
            NodeCost cost;
            cost.compute_cycles = static_cast<size_t>(compute_cycles);
            // ... 其他成本字段
            node->SetCost(cost);
        }

        node_map[name.GetString()] = node;
    }
}
```

**边转换细节**：

```cpp
void DAGAdapter::ConvertEdges(const ge::Graph& ge_graph, DAGGraph& dag_graph,
                              const std::unordered_map<...>& node_map) {
    auto gnodes = ge_graph.GetAllNodes();
    for (const auto& gnode : gnodes) {
        auto src_node = node_map.at(gnode.GetName().GetString());

        for (size_t i = 0; i < gnode.GetOutputsSize(); ++i) {
            auto dst_pairs = gnode.GetOutDataNodesAndPortIndexs(static_cast<int32_t>(i));
            for (const auto& [dst_gnode, dst_port] : dst_pairs) {
                auto dst_node = node_map.at(dst_gnode->GetName().GetString());
                dag_graph.AddEdge(src_node, static_cast<int32_t>(i),
                                  dst_node, dst_port);
            }
        }
    }
}
```

#### 5.2.2 RefreshStreamIdsToGE: 注入stream ID到GE Graph

```cpp
graphStatus DAGAdapter::RefreshStreamIdsToGE(
    const DAGGraph& dag_graph,
    ge::StreamPassContext& context) {

    // 通过节点名匹配
    for (const auto& dag_node : dag_graph.GetAllNodes()) {
        ge::AscendString node_name(dag_node->GetName().c_str());

        // 在GE Graph中找到对应GNode
        // 注意：context操作需要GNode，需要通过图遍历或缓存获取
        // 此处假设有方法获取GNode

        int64_t stream_id = dag_node->GetStreamId();
        // context.SetStreamId(gnode, stream_id);
    }

    return GRAPH_SUCCESS;
}
```

**重要说明**：`RefreshStreamIdsToGE`需要在`CustomAllocateStreamPassFunc`回调中调用：

```cpp
// 用户需要在pass外持有dag_graph
std::shared_ptr<minidag::DAGGraph> g_dag_graph;

ge::REGISTER_CUSTOM_PASS("MyStreamAllocator")
    .CustomAllocateStreamPassFn([](const ge::ConstGraphPtr& graph,
                                    ge::StreamPassContext& context) -> ge::Status {
        if (!g_dag_graph) {
            return ge::FAILED;
        }
        return minidag::DAGAdapter::RefreshStreamIdsToGE(*g_dag_graph, context);
    })
    .Stage(ge::CustomPassStage::kAfterAssignLogicStream);
```

### 5.3 完整使用流程

```cpp
#include "minidag/graph.h"
#include "minidag/stream_allocator.h"
#include "minidag/dag_adapter.h"
#include "register/register_custom_pass.h"

// 全局或类成员持有dag_graph
std::shared_ptr<minidag::DAGGraph> g_dag_graph;

// 注册自定义流分配pass
REGISTER_CUSTOM_PASS("CustomStreamAllocator")
    .CustomAllocateStreamPassFn([](const ge::ConstGraphPtr& graph,
                                    ge::StreamPassContext& context) -> ge::Status {
        // 1. 从GE Graph转换到DAGGraph
        g_dag_graph = minidag::DAGAdapter::FromGEGraph(*graph);

        // 2. 执行流分配算法
        minidag::StreamAllocator::ByLoadBalance(*g_dag_graph, 4);

        // 3. 将stream ID刷新回GE Graph
        return minidag::DAGAdapter::RefreshStreamIdsToGE(*g_dag_graph, context);
    })
    .Stage(ge::CustomPassStage::kAfterAssignLogicStream);

// 或者使用自定义算法
REGISTER_CUSTOM_PASS("CustomStreamAllocator2")
    .CustomAllocateStreamPassFn([](const ge::ConstGraphPtr& graph,
                                    ge::StreamPassContext& context) -> ge::Status {
        g_dag_graph = minidag::DAGAdapter::FromGEGraph(*graph);

        // 使用自定义回调
        minidag::StreamAllocator::Apply(*g_dag_graph, [](minidag::DAGGraph& g) {
            int64_t max_stream = 0;
            for (auto& node : g.GetAllNodes()) {
                int64_t sid = node->GetStreamId();
                if (sid > max_stream) max_stream = sid;
            }
            // 自定义逻辑...
        });

        return minidag::DAGAdapter::RefreshStreamIdsToGE(*g_dag_graph, context);
    })
    .Stage(ge::CustomPassStage::kAfterAssignLogicStream);
```

## 6. StreamPassContext 说明

### 6.1 API 概览

`StreamPassContext`是GE提供的流分配上下文，定义在`inc/graph_metadef/external/register/register_custom_pass.h`：

```cpp
namespace ge {

class StreamPassContext : public CustomPassContext {
public:
    explicit StreamPassContext(int64_t current_max_stream_id);
    ~StreamPassContext() override = default;

    // 设置节点的stream ID
    graphStatus SetStreamId(const GNode& node, int64_t stream_id);

    // 获取节点的stream ID
    int64_t GetStreamId(const GNode& node) const;

    // 分配下一个stream ID（自动递增）
    int64_t AllocateNextStreamId();

    // 获取当前最大stream ID
    int64_t GetCurrMaxStreamId() const;
};

constexpr int64_t INVALID_STREAM_ID = -1;

} // namespace ge
```

### 6.2 使用限制

- 仅在`CustomPassStage::kAfterAssignLogicStream`阶段可用
- 必须在`CustomAllocateStreamPassFunc`回调中使用
- `RefreshStreamIdsToGE`需要传入有效的`StreamPassContext`实例

